
  error[E1291]: jetos real tier could not map every system declaration to NixOS
    D-JOS-NIXBACKEND1=C forbids silently dropping a declaration when generating the hidden NixOS backend; unmapped: no declared source resolves to `NixOS/nixpkgs/<rev-or-ref>@github` (the real tier needs exactly one nixpkgs pin).
    fix: rename or drop the unmapped keys/packages/services, or map them to the nearest supported real-tier option listed in docs/spec/diagnostics.md (E1291).

